{"id":"o-liloli-org","claimKey":"fb6f4e86233ec5f8f4c9374e198498aaf3837f210c4e754e14a03cf0f7df575e","title":"Camp Li-Lo-Li","cat":"outdoor","art":"camping","area":"Niagara, NY","metroId":"niagara","src":"liloli.org","specs":[],"options":[{"name":"Sun setting over cabin","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Summer Camp","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Waterfront / Paddleboard","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Zip Line","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Climbing Tower","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Trail Rides","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Crafts and Woodworking","detail":"","price":null}],"services":[{"name":"Sun setting over cabin","desc":null,"photo":"https://www.liloli.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/LiLoLiPreteenTwo2023-1015.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":0}]},{"name":"Summer Camp","desc":"From the time the campers get up in the morning until they crash into their bunks at night, each day is filled with faith, friends and fun! In addition to time in the Word of God at chapel and in the cabins, there is plenty of time for activities such as team sports, horseback riding, riflery, fishing, boating, swimming, challenge course, climbing tower and crafts. In addition to all these activities, these sessions also offer a unique Achievement program that teaches campers valuable outdoor skills. Designed with teens in mind, these are some of the most memorable weeks of camp! There is buzz all year as campers look forward to seeing their friends again and making new ones. Our","photo":"https://www.liloli.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/LiLoLiPreteenTwo2023-411.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":1}]},{"name":"Waterfront / Paddleboard","desc":null,"photo":"https://www.liloli.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/LiLoLiPreteenTwo2023-695.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":2}]},{"name":"Zip Line","desc":null,"photo":"https://www.liloli.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OMN_4532-scaled.jpg","v